%% OpenSchedule 移动端 · 增量 7 审核对标 · 类图（数据结构与接口）
%% 权威来源：docs/mobile-app/ARCH-mobile-increment-7-audit-alignment.md §4.1
%% 增量 7.1 增补（Route 2 孤儿消除 §2.4.2 + C/E 耦合缺陷 §2.4.3）：见文末 note 与 taskService/auditUtils 成员
classDiagram
    class TaskStatus {
        <<enumeration>>
        todo
        in_progress
        blocked
        done
        cancelled
        pending_review
    }

    class AuditAction {
        <<enumeration>>
        approve
        reject
        withdraw
    }

    class AuditOpinion {
        <<enumeration>>
        agree
        reject
        rework
        other
    }

    class AuditLog {
        +string id
        +string taskId
        +AuditAction action
        +AuditOpinion opinion
        +string reason
        +string operatorId
        +string operatorName
        +string createdAt
    }

    class Task {
        +string id
        +string tenantId
        +string projectId
        +string parentId
        +string title
        +TaskStatus status
        +string assigneeId
        +string completedAt
        +string source
        +SubmissionStatus submissionStatus
        +SubmissionKind submissionKind
        +boolean reviewRequired
        +boolean isReviewTask
        +string[] reviewerIds
        +string reviewNote
        +string reviewedBy
        +string reviewedAt
        +AuditLog[] auditLogs
    }

    class Project {
        +string id
        +string name
        +string ownerId
    }

    class CreateTaskInput {
        +string projectId
        +string title
        +string description
        +TaskPriority priority
        +string assigneeId
        +string dueAt
        +number estimatedHours
        +boolean reviewRequired
    }

    class taskService {
        <<module>>
        +createTask(input: CreateTaskInput) Task
        +completeTask(taskId, input) Task
        +moveTask(taskId, input) Task
        +reopenTask(taskId, input) Task
        +undoCompletion(taskId, input) Task
        +reviewSubmission(taskId, action, version, reason) Task
        +withdrawCompletion(taskId, input) Task
        +listPendingReview(userId) Task[]
        +listDeadlineApproaching(userId, tz) Task[]
        +ensureReviewSubtask(mainTask) Task
        +closeOpenReviewSubtasks(mainTask) void
    }

    class auditService {
        <<module>>
        +listAuditTasks(actorId, isManager) Task[]
        +submitAudit(input) Task
    }

    class auditUtils {
        <<module>>
        +deriveApprovalStatus(task) ApprovalStatus
        +deriveApprovalType(task) ApprovalType
        +derivePendingReview(task) boolean
        +canApproveMainTask(task, children) boolean
        +isTaskRelated(task, userId, isManager) boolean
        +filterPendingReport(tasks) Task[]
        +filterPendingAudit(tasks) Task[]
        +filterApproved(tasks, range) Task[]
        +filterWithdrawnLogs(tasks, range) AuditLogWithTask[]
    }

    Task --> TaskStatus : status
    Task "1" --> "0..*" AuditLog : auditLogs
    Task "1" --> "0..*" Task : children(评审子任务)
    Task --> Project : projectId
    auditService ..> taskService : 编排
    auditService ..> auditUtils : 筛选
    taskService ..> auditUtils : derivePendingReview
    taskService ..> Task : 读写
    taskService ..> CreateTaskInput : 入参
    taskService ..> Task : closeOpenReviewSubtasks 置 status=cancelled

    note for taskService "增量 7.1 · Route 2 · ARCH §2.4.2：closeOpenReviewSubtasks(mainTask) 遍历 db.tasks，对 parentId===mainTask.id 且 isReviewTask===true 且 status 非 done/cancelled 的子任务置 status='cancelled'、version+=1、updatedAt=now()（幂等、零通知）。"
    note for taskService "4 处调用点（reviewRequired 被清除时）：moveTask / reopenTask（clearReviewOnLeaveDone 分支）；undoCompletion（仅当 reviewReset 非空，即 submissionStatus=null；传 'pending' 的审核轮回态不清理）；withdrawCompletion（submissionStatus='withdrawn' 之后）。"
    note for taskService "缺陷 C · ARCH §2.4.3：ensureReviewSubtask 复用过滤 = status 非 done/cancelled ⇒ 不复用已取消的评审子任务。"
    note for auditUtils "缺陷 E · ARCH §2.4.3：canApproveMainTask 过滤排除 child.status==='cancelled' ⇒ cancelled 子任务不阻塞（否则用户取消子任务后门禁永久 false，审批死锁）。"
    note for Task "评审子任务在 UI 即普通 todo 任务，用户可经 TASK_TRANSITION_ACTIONS.todo 的「取消任务」置 cancelled ⇒ 触发 C/E 可达链。"
